    {
      "text": "beginning of his kingdom was Babel, Gen. 10:10. ye shall be unto me a kingdom of priests, Ex. 19:6. told the people the manner of the kingdom, 1 Sam. 10:25. I will establish his kingdom, 2 Sam. 7:12 (1 Chr. 17:11; 28:7). kingdoms of the earth may know that thou art the Lord, 2 Kgs. 19:19 (Isa. 37:20). thine is the kingdom, O Lord, 1 Chr. 29:11. kingdom is the Lord’s, Ps. 22:28. sceptre of thy kingdom is a right sceptre, Ps. 45:6 (Heb. 1:8). Thy kingdom is an everlasting kingdom, Ps. 145:13. tumultuous noise of the kingdoms of nations gathered, Isa. 13:4 (2 Ne. 23:4). made the earth to tremble, that did shake kingdoms, Isa. 14:16 (2 Ne. 24:16). kingdom that will not serve thee shall perish, Isa. 60:12. given thee a kingdom, power, and strength, Dan. 2:37. most High ruleth in the kingdom of men, Dan. 4:17. four kingdoms shall stand up out of the nation, Dan. 8:22.",
